                                                "sense_id": "e09014c9-f8e4-3013-b9f6-355ba460b02f",
                                                "text": "In trans-human state / It's time to evacuate / Waiting for a ride to take them to the gate / Await the siren call / More phenobarbital / Pour it down the hatch, ingest it all"
                                            }
                                        ]
